      "created_at": "2017-09-30T05:21:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cool! Looks like it’s time to go through the wiki.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Omnitron Challenge Mode text is updated to read: “For every 7 damage Omnitron is dealt in a round, the heroes may choose one villain component to destroyed. Ignore the second line of text on villain component cards.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I think there’s a minor typo here. To destroy?</p>\n<p>Also, I notice Imbued Vitality Durasteel Chains can no longer keep The Sentinels alive.</p>",
