      "created_at": "2017-10-02T14:47:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Question on the card Heroes Unallied in Miss Info’s deck: If damage is redirected this way but then reduced to 0 by a damage reducing effect, should Heroes Unallied be destroyed?</p>\n<p>I would think it would be destroyed since the card doesn’t say “if damage is dealt this way.” Currently it is not destroyed in the video game, but I’m not sure if that’s a bug or intended behavior.</p>",
