      "created_at": "2017-10-03T00:20:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Should resolve like single redirections sending damage to targets immune to damage, the redirection effect occured, and the effect is consumed. &nbsp;Now if the damage is prevented before it can trigger redirection, then the card would stay in play as the effect didn't occur.</p>",
